</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Small group classes, beginner-friendly programs</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Financial Limitations</bold></p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Gym memberships, equipment costs</p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Free and low-cost alternatives, community programs</p>
</td>
