</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </table-wrap>
        <p>
<bold>Sleep hygiene interventions</bold>
</p>
        <p>Several strategies are recommended to help improve various components of sleep hygiene (see&#x000a0;<bold>Table 12</bold>).</p>
        <table-wrap id="article-179694.table14" position="float" orientation="portrait">
          <caption>
            <title>Table 12. Sleep Hygiene Recommendations</title>
          </caption>
          <table style="width: 800px;" border="1" cellspacing="1" cellpadding="5">
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Component</bold></p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Specific Recommendations</bold></p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Implementation Strategies</bold></p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Clinical Monitoring</bold></p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Evidence Grade</bold></p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
