</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Reading, gentle stretching, meditation</p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Routine consistency tracking</p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>B (Moderate)</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Electronic Devices</bold></p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>No screens 1 hour before bed</p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Blue light filters, charging stations outside the bedroom</p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Device usage monitoring</p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>A (Strong)</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Caffeine/Alcohol</bold></p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>No caffeine after 2 PM, limit alcohol</p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Alternative beverages, education on the timing of consumption</p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Substance use diary</p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>A (Strong)</p>
</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </table-wrap>
        <p>
<bold>Stress management and obesity</bold>
</p>
        <p>Chronic stress contributes to obesity through multiple interconnected pathways involving hormonal dysregulation, behavioral modifications, and metabolic dysfunction. Chronic stress leads to sustained cortisol elevation, promoting visceral fat accumulation and insulin resistance through well-documented mechanisms.<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-179694.r15">[15]</xref>&#x000a0;Therefore, clinicians may advise patients on implementing various techniques to decrease stress (see&#x000a0;<bold>Table 13</bold>).</p>
        <table-wrap id="article-179694.table15" position="float" orientation="portrait">
          <caption>
            <title>Table 13. Stress Management Techniques for Obesity</title>
          </caption>
          <table style="width: 800px;" border="1" cellspacing="1" cellpadding="5">
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
