</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Diaphragmatic breathing techniques</p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>5 to 10 min, multiple times daily</p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Strong (Grade A)</p>
</td>
