</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Cognitive behavioral therapy techniques, reframing</p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Ongoing practice</p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Strong (Grade A)</p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Reduces emotional eating patterns</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Physical Acti</bold><bold>vity</bold></p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
