</td>
                <td style="width: 142.693px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Family member skepticism, sabotage</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 185px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Family education, goal alignment discussions</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="width: 114px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Informational Support</bold></p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 194.307px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Sharing resources, learning together</p>
</td>
