</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Early in treatment, if indicated</p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Optimized metabolic management</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Bariatric Surgeon</bold></p>
</td>
                <td rowspan="1" colspan="1">
