        </table-wrap>
        <p>
<bold>Evidence-based maintenance strategies</bold>
</p>
        <p>The National Weight Control Registry tracks over 10,000 individuals who have maintained a weight loss of 30 pounds or more for at least 1 year, providing evidence-based insights into successful maintenance behaviors (see&#x000a0;<bold>Table 20</bold>). Successful weight loss maintenance requires specific strategies and behaviors that differ from those used in initial weight loss approaches.<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-179694.r22">[22]</xref></p>
