        <p>
<bold>Monitoring parameters and assessment tools</bold>
</p>
        <p>Clinicians may use various assessment tools to monitor patient weight loss (see&#x000a0;<bold>Table 21</bold>).</p>
        <table-wrap id="article-179694.table23" position="float" orientation="portrait">
          <caption>
            <title>Table 21. Long-Term Monitoring Schedule and Parameters</title>
          </caption>
          <table style="width: 800px;" border="1" cellspacing="1" cellpadding="5">
