</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="width: 92.1964px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Months 6&#x02013;12</bold></p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 150.804px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Maintenance transition, relapse prevention</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 192px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Bi-monthly weight, annual labs</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 183px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Eating patterns, exercise habits</p>
</td>
